WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.057 --> 00:00:04.030
Your regulars are your salon's most valuable asset.

00:00:04.118 --> 00:00:06.590
VaraaAi's loyalty cards help you keep them:

00:00:06.877 --> 00:00:10.279
every visit earns the customer a ticket, and with enough tickets,

00:00:10.229 --> 00:00:11.310
they get a discount.

00:00:11.852 --> 00:00:13.161
Tap Loyalty cards.

00:00:13.323 --> 00:00:16.361
First, set up the programme under Program settings:

00:00:16.469 --> 00:00:20.266
how many visits a customer needs for a discount, the discount percentage,

00:00:20.216 --> 00:00:21.241
and the card price.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:23.401
Leave it at zero if the card is free.

00:00:23.749 --> 00:00:25.001
Then tap Save.

00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:29.173
To give a customer a card, go to Activate a card for a customer.

00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:33.573
Enter their name and email, then tap Activate and email the QR.

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:38.213
The customer gets their card, with its QR code, by email straight away.

00:00:38.741 --> 00:00:40.452
Each time the customer visits,

00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:43.443
scan the QR code on their card with your phone camera,

00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:45.493
or type the code printed on the card,

00:00:45.688 --> 00:00:47.653
then tap Add 1 ticket.

00:00:48.002 --> 00:00:52.453
The screen says Scanned, plus one point, and shows the customer's card:

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:56.133
how many tickets they have, and how many more they need for the discount.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:00.217
When a customer has enough tickets, their card shows a reward waiting.

00:01:00.691 --> 00:01:03.497
Give them the discount, then keep adding tickets as usual.

00:01:03.925 --> 00:01:07.848
In the Cardholders list, you can see how many tickets each customer has,

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:10.377
and how many times their card has been scanned.

00:01:10.798 --> 00:01:12.057
Now take the quiz below.
